flowchart LR
  Request --> Intent[Intent + context]
  Intent --> Catalog[Live SQL catalog search]
  Catalog --> Specific[Direct product match\nname / Arabic name / alias / generic / SKU]
  Specific --> Exact{Specific product found?}
  Exact -- yes --> Product[Only requested product\nprice + stock]
  Exact -- no --> Category{Generic category request?}
  Category -- yes --> Products[All live products in that category]
  Category -- no --> Approx[Approximate alternatives\nnot orderable]
  Product --> RxGate
  Products --> RxGate
  RxGate -- Rx --> PrescriptionLead
  RxGate -- OTC --> Confirmation --> Details[Free-form name + phone + address]
  Details --> Extract[Parse + validate explicit fields]
  Extract --> Complete{All checkout fields valid?}
  Complete -- no --> Ask[Ask only for missing or unclear field]
  Ask --> Details
  Complete -- yes --> Review[Show product + customer + delivery + total]
  Review --> Correction{Customer corrects details?}
  Correction -- yes --> Details
  Correction -- no: explicit confirm --> CreateOrder
  CreateOrder --> Transaction[price + stock + order] --> Result
